# Cline Rules - Mascarade

## Always Load
- .github/copilot-instructions.md

## Conditional Instructions
- core/**/*.py -> .github/instructions/core-python.instructions.md
- api/src/**/*.ts -> .github/instructions/api-hono.instructions.md
- web/src/**/*.{ts,tsx} -> .github/instructions/web-react.instructions.md
- deploy/** -> .github/instructions/deploy.instructions.md
- any setup/debug task -> .github/instructions/dev-environment.instructions.md

## Working Rules
- Do not mix stacks in one patch unless explicitly requested.
- Preserve existing behavior and public contracts.
- Validate only the touched stack unless a cross-stack dependency changed.
- Keep changes deterministic and easy to review.
